# Insurance claim. The workflow comes from definitions/insurance_claim.definition.
INDUSTRY|Insurance
WORKFLOW|INS_CLAIM
STARTED_BY|ClaimsClerk
EXPECTED|A paid settlement, or a decline notice when assessment or approval refuses the claim. Amount 20000 stays with the assessor, 60000 goes to the manager and 200000 to the committee. Amount 200000 is over the bank limit and the payment escalates.
