PARTICIPANT|ins-committee|Naledi Tau|ClaimsCommittee
OUTCOMES|ASSESS_CLAIM|accept,decline
OUTCOMES|APPROVE_CLAIM|approved,not approved
FIELD|surname|Policyholder surname
FIELD|idNumber|Policyholder ID number, 13 digits
TASK_FIELD|VERIFY_POLICY|surname|Policyholder surname
TASK_FIELD|VERIFY_POLICY|idNumber|Policyholder ID number, 13 digits
TASK_FIELD|COLLECT|amount|Claim amount in rands
TASK_FIELD|COLLECT|accountNumber|Bank account, 9 to 11 digits
TASK_FIELD|COLLECT|branchCode|Branch code
